    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40496" root="نكد" body-key="n">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَكَّدَ عَطَآءَهُ بِٱلْمَنِّ</span></b>  <i>He impaired his gift by
reproach.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نكّد وَسْقَهُ</span> <i>He spent,</i> or <i>exhausted, what he possessed, in consequence of
frequent petitions.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نكّدهُ</span> <i>He vexed, distressed,</i> or <i>troubled, him;</i> (Gol, from Meyd.) [as
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نكّد عَلَيْهِ</span>].

